                                                "sense_id": "ec8a4a31-22f6-32ac-bd6c-d024dee5a199",
                                                "text": "So you know, we have a good case with an increasing body of evidence, supported by a trifecta of research from human epidemiology, animal and in vitro studies, which suggests that prenatal acetaminophen or paracetamol might alter fetal development, increasing the risk of neurodevelopmental disorders."
                                            }
